      "vision_vetted": true,
      "vision_reason": "A bronze crowned and bejeweled Buddha (bodhisattva-style ornamented Buddha) seated in bhumisparsa mudra, a form long produced in Burmese Buddhist tradition (Ava/Konbaung period); fits the claimed Burmese/regional attribution as a devotional metal sculpture.",
